{"id": "votes-on-interests-not-in-the-title", "title": "How two supervisors’ votes connect to their financial disclosures", "seconds": 65.3, "voice": "elevenlabs:9PVP7ENhDskL0KYHAKtD", "narrator": "Jerry B.", "made": "2026-11-25", "key": "18ac32957ae26476", "words": 185, "beats": [{"scene": "open", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]"], "text": "A grant allocation of 136,396 dollars appears in a contract notice.", "t0": 0.2, "t1": 5.72, "shot": "1", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$136,396", "label": "grant allocation in File 240368"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.45, 1.07, 1.21, 1.38, 1.63, 2.19, 2.61, 2.85, 3.14, 3.69, 4.07, 4.46, 4.55, 4.64, 5.13]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[2]"], "text": "The vote covered a whole grant program. The title did not name this recipient.", "t0": 5.84, "t1": 9.8, "shot": "2", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "m126", "kicker": "San Francisco Ethics Commission", "text": "Form 126", "mark": "Form 126"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.17, 0.46, 0.77, 0.85, 1.08, 1.36, 2.15, 2.35, 2.66, 2.84, 3.03, 3.25, 3.43]}, {"scene": "open", "kind": "record", "ref": ["notEstablished[0]", "established[5]"], "text": "The overlap raises a lead, not a finding.", "t0": 9.92, "t1": 12.08, "shot": "3", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "relationship", "context": "Mission Economic Development Agency", "heading": "Disclosures and the vote", "source": "m126", "rows": [{"icon": "travel", "label": "Reported travel payment", "value": "$1,666.18"}, {"icon": "vote", "label": "Myrna Melgar voted for program", "value": "May 2024"}, {"icon": "file", "label": "Grant allocation", "value": "$136,396"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.67, 1.0, 1.08, 1.41, 1.61, 1.68]}, {"scene": "travel", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["suspicious[2]", "established[5]"], "text": "Myrna Melgar disclosed a Chicago trip paid by Mission Economic Development Agency.", "t0": 12.3, "t1": 16.53, "shot": "5", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$1,666.18", "label": "travel reported by Myrna Melgar"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.32, 0.74, 1.18, 1.25, 1.76, 2.04, 2.27, 2.46, 2.78, 3.26, 3.73]}, {"scene": "travel", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[5]"], "text": "She voted for the program in May 2024. Its contract notice names the same organization.", "t0": 16.65, "t1": 22.13, "shot": "6", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "vm1", "kicker": "San Francisco Board of Supervisors", "text": "File 240368 · 7 May 2024", "mark": "File 240368 · 7 May 2024"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.48, 0.61, 0.73, 1.23, 1.37, 1.58, 1.87, 2.96, 3.21, 3.71, 4.07, 4.36, 4.47, 4.73]}, {"scene": "rates", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[0]", "established[0]"], "text": "Shamann Walton’s statements listed family income from Kaiser Permanente for four years.", "t0": 22.35, "t1": 26.67, "shot": "8", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "f7c", "kicker": "San Francisco Ethics Commission", "text": "Kaiser Permanente · 2020 to 2023", "mark": "Kaiser Permanente · 2020 to 2023"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.45, 0.81, 1.27, 1.62, 1.99, 2.32, 2.48, 2.82, 3.49, 3.67, 3.94]}, {"scene": "rates", "kind": "record", "ref": ["established[1]", "established[0]", "established[2]"], "text": "He voted for annual health-plan rates. Each final vote passed eleven to zero.", "t0": 26.79, "t1": 31.26, "shot": "9", "visual": {"type": "record", "layout": "relationship", "context": "2020 to 2023 health-plan votes", "heading": "What the filings identify", "source": "k126a", "rows": [{"icon": "file", "label": "Income disclosure", "value": "Kaiser Permanente"}, {"icon": "vote", "label": "Contract notice", "value": "Kaiser Foundation Health Plan"}, {"icon": "gap", "label": "Spouse’s employing entity", "value": "Unknown"}]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.19, 0.52, 0.71, 1.07, 1.61, 2.4, 2.65, 3.0, 3.27, 3.6, 3.95, 4.06]}, {"scene": "rates", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[2]"], "text": "The notices name Kaiser Foundation Health Plan. The spouse’s exact employer remains unknown.", "t0": 31.38, "t1": 36.6, "shot": "10", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "k126a", "kicker": "San Francisco Ethics Commission", "text": "Form 126 · Kaiser Foundation Health Plan", "mark": "Form 126 · Kaiser Foundation Health Plan"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.15, 0.65, 0.92, 1.29, 1.87, 2.09, 2.75, 2.89, 3.37, 3.81, 4.34, 4.74]}, {"scene": "rates", "kind": "bignum", "ref": ["established[3]"], "text": "These payments cover health-plan premiums. They do not measure a public loss.", "t0": 36.72, "t1": 40.63, "shot": "11", "visual": {"type": "bignum", "value": "$501.2 million", "label": "fiscal 2021 health-plan payments"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.59, 0.89, 1.38, 2.13, 2.34, 2.54, 2.76, 3.08, 3.17, 3.51]}, {"scene": "rates", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[1]", "established[4]"], "text": "Three of the annual statements carry the same November 2022 filing date.", "t0": 40.75, "t1": 44.63, "shot": "12", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "f7v", "kicker": "San Francisco Ethics Commission", "text": "9 November 2022", "mark": "9 November 2022"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.22, 0.3, 0.44, 0.78, 1.22, 1.51, 1.64, 1.95, 2.38, 2.71, 3.24, 3.64]}, {"scene": "rates", "kind": "quote", "ref": ["notEstablished[2]"], "text": "The published records cannot establish whether earlier versions existed.", "t0": 44.75, "t1": 48.29, "shot": "13", "visual": {"type": "quote", "line": "Were there earlier versions?"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.11, 0.52, 0.89, 1.26, 1.8, 2.16, 2.58, 2.98]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["suspicious[3]", "established[6]"], "text": "The recusal register lists no notice from either supervisor.", "t0": 48.51, "t1": 51.56, "shot": "15", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "rec", "kicker": "San Francisco Ethics Commission", "text": "Form 3209b", "mark": "Form 3209b"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.14, 0.62, 1.1, 1.41, 1.64, 1.96, 2.14, 2.36]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "unknowns", "ref": ["notEstablished[1]"], "text": "The votes approved entire programs. Any effect on a particular recipient needs further review.", "t0": 51.68, "t1": 56.75, "shot": "16", "visual": {"type": "unknowns", "cards": ["Effect of a vote covering all plans", "Material effect of the grant"]}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.45, 0.85, 1.25, 2.15, 2.44, 2.8, 2.9, 2.98, 3.48, 4.04, 4.31, 4.65]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "doc", "ref": ["established[7]"], "text": "Travel reporting and disqualification are separate. The effect of a decision on the payer matters.", "t0": 56.87, "t1": 61.92, "shot": "travelrule", "visual": {"type": "doc", "source": "travel2324", "text": "Reportable travel and participation in decisions", "mark": "Reportable travel and participation in decisions", "kicker": "FPPC guidance · 2023–24"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.35, 0.77, 0.87, 1.8, 1.95, 2.84, 3.01, 3.36, 3.46, 3.56, 4.02, 4.14, 4.24, 4.59]}, {"scene": "close", "kind": "end", "ref": ["status"], "text": "A lead is a question, not an accusation.", "t0": 62.04, "t1": 64.39, "shot": "17", "visual": {"type": "end"}, "wt": [0.0, 0.16, 0.38, 0.5, 0.58, 1.3, 1.53, 1.63]}], "format": 6, "chapters": {"open": "Votes and disclosures", "travel": "Travel and the grant", "rates": "Health-plan rates", "close": "What is open"}, "look": "dossier", "hook": "person"}